Error: Resource precondition failed

  on dossier-refresh.tf line 270, in resource "aws_ecs_cluster" "dossier_refresh":
 270:       condition     = var.dossier_refresh_build_enabled
    +----------------
    | var.dossier_refresh_build_enabled is false

dossier_refresh_run_enabled = true requires dossier_refresh_build_enabled =
true: the image must be built (the ECR repository and the CodeBuild project
are in the build half, in the same state) before the task definition can name
its digest. Apply the build half first.

